                  "value": "<div class=\"fn value\">\n<dl><dd>Roberts, A</dd>\n<dd>Anatolius Vindanius, of Berytus</dd>\n<dd>Arnobius, of Sicca</dd>\n<dd>Asterius</dd>\n<dd>Athenagoras, 2nd cent</dd>\n<dd>Caius</dd>\n<dd>Clement</dd>\n<dd>Clement, of Alexandria, Saint, ca. 150-ca. 215</dd>\n<dd>Commodian</dd>\n<dd>Cyprian, Saint, Bishop of Carthage</dd>\n<dd>Dionysius</dd>\n<dd>Dionysius the Great</dd>\n<dd>Gregory, Thaumaturgus, Saint, ca. 213-ca. 270</dd>\n<dd>Hermas, 2nd cent</dd>\n<dd>Hippolytus, Antipope, ca. 170-235 or 6</dd>\n<dd>Ignatius</dd>\n<dd>Irenaeus, Saint, Bishop of Lyon</dd>\n<dd>Julius Africanus</dd>\n<dd>Justin, Martyr, Saint</dd>\n<dd>Lactantius, ca. 240-ca. 320</dd>\n<dd>Methodius</dd>\n<dd>Minucius Felix, Marcus</dd>\n<dd>Novatianus</dd>\n<dd>Origen</dd>\n<dd>Polycarp, Saint, Bishop of Smyrna</dd>\n<dd>Tatian, ca. 120-173</dd>\n<dd>Tertullian, ca. 160-ca. 230</dd>\n<dd>Theodotus</dd>\n<dd>Theophilus</dd>\n<dd>Fortunatus, Venantius Honorius Clementianus, ca. 540-ca. 600</dd>\n<dd>Victorinus</dd></dl></div>",
                  "source": "commons-desc-page"
